1
00:01:37,830 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,180 --> 00:01:43,670
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,670 --> 00:01:45,950
[Episode 3]

4
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,520
How did he get here before us?

5
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,480
Li Qingyang,

6
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,040
do you know the punishment

7
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,570
for breaking out of prison?

8
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,280
Lady Constable Frost,

9
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,470
this isn't the first time

10
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:11,930
I've broken out of prison.

11
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,120
Besides,

12
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,590
the shackles
of your Divine Constable Bureau

13
00:02:14,590 --> 00:02:15,560
can't trap me.

14
00:02:15,910 --> 00:02:17,079
Instead of sitting and waiting there,

15
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,280
being wronged by you,

16
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,410
I'd rather take the initiative to move

17
00:02:20,470 --> 00:02:22,910
and catch the real culprit
to prove my innocence.

18
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:23,960
This way,

19
00:02:24,190 --> 00:02:25,360
even if I

20
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,430
have offended your bureau a lot,

21
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:29,430
I can make up for it.

22
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:30,280
Right?

23
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:31,630
Chief,

24
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:32,910
if we run into Li Qingyang,

25
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:34,079
what should we do?

26
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,360
This person is highly suspicious.

27
00:02:36,710 --> 00:02:37,710
If he's caught,

28
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,280
bring him back to the bureau.

29
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,800
I'll interrogate him in person.

30
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:43,520
If he still won't behave,

31
00:02:44,310 --> 00:02:45,630
don't push too hard.

32
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:48,280
Observe his words and actions.

33
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:51,079
Only then can you know what he's up to.

34
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:52,680
Alright,

35
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:53,680
let me see

36
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:55,360
how you prove your innocence.

37
00:02:56,079 --> 00:02:56,870
Please.

38
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,710
Thank you, Lady Constable Frost.

39
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:12,310
According to what the Advisor said,

40
00:03:12,310 --> 00:03:14,170
he saw the coroner, Wen Nansheng,

41
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,970
carrying this bundle out.

42
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,240
Undoubtedly,

43
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,520
inside this bag are

44
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,150
Master Sun's body parts.

45
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:21,710
And Wen Nansheng

46
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,680
abandoned the body here and fled.

47
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,920
Tell us something we don't know.

48
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,140
Wen Nansheng's jade pendant?

49
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:55,079
This head is indeed Master Sun's,

50
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,560
but only the upper half
of the body is his.

51
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,760
The lower half isn't.

52
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,820
Are you so sure, Constable Frost?

53
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:04,120
I can tell everything about a body

54
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,750
that I've handled at a glance.

55
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:07,080
Judging from the corpse's swollen legs,

56
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,910
they were mostly caused

57
00:04:07,910 --> 00:04:09,870
by the coroner's long exposure
to damp places.

58
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:11,840
The jade pendant left on these clothes

59
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,280
belongs to Wen Nansheng.

60
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:15,310
But judging from the cut,

61
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,190
the murder weapon is still

62
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:19,720
the silk thread used
to control puppet dolls.

63
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,270
I got it.

64
00:04:24,630 --> 00:04:26,680
The murderer first killed Master Sun

65
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:29,310
and then killed Wen Nansheng.

66
00:04:29,630 --> 00:04:30,630
He mixed the lower half

67
00:04:30,630 --> 00:04:31,890
of Wen Nansheng's body

68
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:33,750
with the upper half

69
00:04:33,750 --> 00:04:34,950
of Master Sun's body.

70
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,920
Then he took away

71
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,520
the lower half of Master Sun.

72
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,510
He did this

73
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:42,310
to make people mistakenly believe

74
00:04:42,310 --> 00:04:43,720
that from beginning to end,

75
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,190
there was only one corpse—

76
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:46,480
Master Sun's body.

77
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:49,680
Continue.

78
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,390
Ms. Bai,

79
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:57,120
does Dead Bone Spice
have the effect of warding off evil?

80
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:59,720
It is indeed recorded
in the Strange Medicines Chapter.

81
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,870
Why do you ask?

82
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,780
Last night, Mr. Meng and I were

83
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,240
repeatedly caught in illusions.

84
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,390
But today,

85
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,160
we are both completely fine.

86
00:05:09,470 --> 00:05:10,660
You mean

87
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:12,680
the scent of Dead Bone Spice
on the silk thread

88
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,410
broke the illusion formation?

89
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,120
No wonder.

90
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:17,240
A lot of young women were

91
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:18,630
murdered in Tianhuang City.

92
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:19,310
This shows the murderer

93
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,750
needs a large amount of Dead Bone Spice

94
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,750
to safely enter

95
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:23,880
the Black Wind Forest in Dougu County.

96
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,310
It seems that Dead Bone Spice is

97
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:26,770
going to be a key clue next.

98
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,950
Don't forget

99
00:05:29,070 --> 00:05:30,240
about the puppet doll

100
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,750
that abducted the children.

101
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:32,680
Puppet doll?

102
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:35,120
It's all based on eyewitness statements.

103
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,159
Did you see it?

104
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,510
Not exactly.

105
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:41,120
Li Qingyang,

106
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,480
I still remember

107
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:43,190
the puppet doll found

108
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:44,560
in your Star-Gathering Pavilion.

109
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,190
What on earth are you up to?

110
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:53,120
My Lord, My Lady,

111
00:05:53,750 --> 00:05:55,150
there's no time to waste.

112
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,950
Most of the spice shops here

113
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,890
don't sell Dead Bone Spice,

114
00:05:58,950 --> 00:05:59,720
but

115
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:02,560
we should still go try our luck.

116
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,560
Perhaps

117
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,720
there will be new clues.

118
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,160
Ms. Bai,

119
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:32,960
what do you mean by this?

120
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:37,240
Sealed acupoints with golden needles.

121
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,430
Your lightness skill is marvelous.

122
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:39,560
I have to be on guard.

123
00:06:40,310 --> 00:06:41,190
Sorry for that.

124
00:06:43,930 --> 00:06:46,070
[Dougu]

125
00:06:46,150 --> 00:06:48,310
[Tumi House]

126
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:57,250
[Tumi House]

127
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:54,760
My Lord, My Lady,

128
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:56,040
this is the most famous spice shop

129
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,360
in our county.

130
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,800
Tumi House?

131
00:07:04,750 --> 00:07:05,560
Bro,

132
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,800
why are you carrying

133
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,160
a puppet doll on your back?

134
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,950
This?

135
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:11,160
I borrowed it from a troupe.

136
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,560
It's just a normal puppet

137
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,240
for those eyewitnesses to identify.

138
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:16,700
But they all said
they didn't see it clearly.

139
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,100
[Tumi House]

140
00:07:20,390 --> 00:07:21,190
Li Qingyang.

141
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,370
Who allowed you to go in?

142
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,120
Ms. Bai,

143
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:28,040
my acupoints are sealed
with golden needles.

144
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:30,040
What tricks can I possibly play now?

145
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,720
My Lord, My Lady,

146
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,270
please be extra careful going in.

147
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:36,200
What do you mean?

148
00:07:36,630 --> 00:07:38,720
Something happened
to this shop not long ago.

149
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,560
The owner of this shop

150
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,270
has gone mad.

151
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:44,950
I

152
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,430
missed you so much.

153
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,800
You look unfamiliar, sir.

154
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,340
What brings you

155
00:07:57,159 --> 00:07:58,870
to my Tumi House?

156
00:07:58,870 --> 00:07:59,680
I'm here

157
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,800
to ask about a kind of spice.

158
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,360
Could it be

159
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,720
Dead Bone Spice?

160
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:14,870
Sir,

161
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:18,430
I am still

162
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:20,680
an unmarried maiden.

163
00:08:25,870 --> 00:08:27,920
Staring at me like this is

164
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,600
quite impertinent.

165
00:08:39,539 --> 00:08:41,140
It really is Dead Bone Spice.

166
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,270
How could this be?

167
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,100
Why are you surprised?

168
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:46,360
Refining Dead Bone Spice

169
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,440
requires the blood of young girls

170
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,720
with pure Yin birth characters.

171
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,080
In the past, if a poor girl

172
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,910
who met the conditions
fell terminally ill,

173
00:08:51,910 --> 00:08:53,840
she would be sold to spice refiners,

174
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:55,900
who used her body to refine the Spice.

175
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,360
This was a way to earn money
for her family

176
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,270
in her final days.

177
00:08:58,270 --> 00:08:59,030
Exactly.

178
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:01,270
The rare Dead Bone Spice

179
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,150
in Tianhuang City's black market

180
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:04,600
mostly comes from this.

181
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:06,890
Such an opportunity is

182
00:09:06,910 --> 00:09:09,600
hard to come by even in decades.

183
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:13,150
So even across the entire Great Shi,

184
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:15,680
the supply
of Dead Bone Spice is very limited.

185
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:17,080
I didn't expect

186
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:20,630
that such a remote, rural backwater
like Dougu County

187
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,900
would have this rare Dead Bone Spice.

188
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,870
Tumi House was burglarized

189
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,150
2 months ago.

190
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,870
Actually, not too many spices were

191
00:09:27,870 --> 00:09:28,960
missing from the House.

192
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,750
But

193
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:30,960
somehow,

194
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,080
the owner of this shop

195
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,720
seemed to have

196
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,910
suffered a great hit

197
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,150
and gone mad.

198
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,870
Two months ago?

199
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:40,630
The case of refining the Spice
with young girls in Tianhuang City

200
00:09:40,630 --> 00:09:42,360
and the disappearance of children
in Dougu County

201
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,030
were both...

202
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:45,080
They both started 2 months ago.

203
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:49,530
Could the stolen item be
Dead Bone Spice?

204
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:51,320
I have never seen that legendary

205
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,550
and precious item,

206
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,720
so I'm not too sure either.

207
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,420
Who robbed the spice shop?

208
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:57,870
Has the case been solved?

209
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:58,670
Well...

210
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:01,220
You can neither find the missing children

211
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:02,720
nor catch a petty thief!

212
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,030
Your Dougu County government is really...

213
00:10:04,030 --> 00:10:04,750
My Lady,

214
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:06,550
you can't blame it on us.

215
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:08,030
This theft case is really

216
00:10:08,030 --> 00:10:08,960
quite bizarre.

217
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:10,960
As you can see,

218
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,030
to keep the fragrance,

219
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:14,720
Tumi House has sealed
all the windows here.

220
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,670
The only opening is this door.

221
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,630
The spices here are so precious

222
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,870
that the owner would lock the door

223
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,960
when he closes the shop every day.

224
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,630
After the incident,

225
00:10:21,630 --> 00:10:23,080
we also checked the lock,

226
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,480
and it was intact.

227
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,240
In a situation like this,

228
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,360
unless...

229
00:10:31,170 --> 00:10:32,910
Unless it was a ghost manifesting,

230
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:33,750
how else could

231
00:10:33,750 --> 00:10:35,000
this be explained?

232
00:10:36,630 --> 00:10:38,360
No other entrance or exit
besides the door?

233
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,360
Then what is this?

234
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:42,720
Ms. Bai,

235
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:45,120
this dog hole is too small

236
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,310
even for a 7-year-old child

237
00:10:46,310 --> 00:10:47,120
to get in,

238
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,550
let alone a thief.

239
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,510
You may go out first.

240
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:53,200
Bring Young Master Qingyang out, too.

241
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:53,930
Understood.

242
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:55,440
Don't bother.

243
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,380
I will leave by myself.

244
00:11:05,030 --> 00:11:06,080
He is right.

245
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,600
Even one who masters

246
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:09,030
the Bone-Shrinking Technique or something

247
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,270
can't get out.

248
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,270
Unless

249
00:11:11,630 --> 00:11:13,360
the thief is the size of a child.

250
00:11:47,150 --> 00:11:48,390
The puppet doll...

251
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:04,600
What is this?

252
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:06,670
Puppetry.

253
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,010
I've learned it.

254
00:12:09,870 --> 00:12:11,080
Lady Constable Frost,

255
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:12,510
didn't you find one

256
00:12:12,530 --> 00:12:14,150
in my Star-Gathering Pavilion?

257
00:12:14,150 --> 00:12:14,960
What?

258
00:12:15,270 --> 00:12:16,400
Have you forgotten?

259
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,550
I didn't expect you
to still be able to perform

260
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:21,510
puppetry with your acupoints sealed
by golden needles.

261
00:12:21,510 --> 00:12:23,170
I really underestimated you.

262
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:29,870
Sealing acupoints with golden needles
restricts inner power.

263
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:32,470
What does it have to do
with controlling a puppet?

264
00:12:32,470 --> 00:12:33,320
Are

265
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:36,240
inner power masters
the only ones in the world

266
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,720
who can perform puppetry?

267
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,360
At least it proves

268
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,750
that a puppet doll
can crawl through this dog hole

269
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:44,080
to steal the Dead Bone Spice.

270
00:12:44,080 --> 00:12:45,360
So the spice thief is

271
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,360
someone who can

272
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,870
control puppet dolls.

273
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,080
I don't think so.

274
00:12:51,030 --> 00:12:51,840
Firstly,

275
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:54,010
many people can control puppets.

276
00:12:54,550 --> 00:12:55,360
Secondly,

277
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,360
actually, a puppet doll

278
00:12:57,670 --> 00:12:59,470
can't steal the Dead Bone Spice.

279
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,750
I did this experiment

280
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:04,080
just to prove this point.

281
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:08,360
Indeed,

282
00:13:09,150 --> 00:13:10,550
it can crawl in.

283
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,550
However,

284
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:14,160
what happens after it crawls in?

285
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,150
A puppet is not a dog.

286
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:19,470
How could it steal the Spice?

287
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,440
You are just a beginner in puppetry.

288
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:26,720
Just because you can't do it

289
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,780
doesn't mean your accomplice can't.

290
00:13:33,330 --> 00:13:34,590
Lady Constable Frost,

291
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:37,030
puppetry is basically

292
00:13:37,150 --> 00:13:38,610
an extension of the hands.

293
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:39,820
A puppet is not a human.

294
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:41,630
It cannot see or think.

295
00:13:41,970 --> 00:13:44,560
If the murderer outside the dog hole

296
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,750
couldn't see the situation inside,

297
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:48,220
it'd be absolutely impossible for him

298
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:49,030
to control the puppet

299
00:13:49,030 --> 00:13:51,290
to steal the Dead Bone Spice from inside.

300
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,120
Unless

301
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,150
someone can train a puppet

302
00:13:54,150 --> 00:13:55,360
to have a mind.

303
00:13:55,750 --> 00:13:56,590
Otherwise,

304
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,620
as long as it's just puppetry,

305
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:01,200
it's definitely impossible
to achieve this.

306
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,150
Seems like

307
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:06,080
the clue has gone cold again.

308
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:10,800
My Lord, My Lady,

309
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:12,320
do you want to hear

310
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:14,150
the clues I've found?

311
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:27,000
The spices brought in by this Tumi House

312
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,200
in Dougu County are famous far and wide.

313
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:30,550
It's said

314
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:33,120
that the original owner here was

315
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,720
a graceful young woman.

316
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:37,870
Everyone called her Lady Fragrance.

317
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:41,550
But now, look

318
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,350
at this shop owner in front of us.

319
00:14:44,150 --> 00:14:45,910
If you call him a lady,

320
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,600
everyone in Dougu County

321
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,550
must be blind.

322
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,920
Then who exactly is this person?

323
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,200
Two months ago,

324
00:14:56,750 --> 00:14:58,910
the Dead Bone Spice
in Tianhuang City's black market was

325
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:00,320
so valuable and hard to come by.

326
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:03,080
You two also know about this.

327
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,750
Soon after,

328
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:07,670
Lady Fragrance
disappeared without a trace.

329
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:08,910
At this time,

330
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:10,550
here in Tumi House,

331
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:13,600
a heavily made-up Mr. Fragrance

332
00:15:13,630 --> 00:15:15,910
appeared out of nowhere.

333
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:19,960
I heard

334
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,550
that Lady Fragrance

335
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,720
has an elder brother.

336
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,960
You mean

337
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,960
the brother killed his younger sister

338
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:32,490
to refine Dead Bone Spice
and rake in profits?

339
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,520
This blood-stained,

340
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,960
invaluable Dead Bone Spice

341
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,550
was stolen overnight.

342
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:47,840
Since then, he has turned

343
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,200
into the way he is now.

344
00:15:49,670 --> 00:15:51,150
The county government
couldn't find evidence

345
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:52,630
to prove he committed murder,

346
00:15:52,630 --> 00:15:53,790
and neither did they find

347
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:55,120
Lady Fragrance's body.

348
00:15:55,630 --> 00:15:57,320
Given his current state,

349
00:15:57,550 --> 00:15:58,750
County Magistrate Du

350
00:15:59,030 --> 00:16:00,960
just left him alone.

351
00:16:04,550 --> 00:16:06,870
Brother,

352
00:16:07,150 --> 00:16:11,720
you're here.

353
00:16:12,510 --> 00:16:13,750
I

354
00:16:15,150 --> 00:16:21,480
missed you so much.

355
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,000
If the spice thief is

356
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,800
the murderer we're looking for,

357
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,720
then everything lines up.

358
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:27,720
Exactly.

359
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,870
A puppet doll was used
in the case of refining the Spice

360
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,360
with young girls in Tianhuang City.

361
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,720
The missing children here were

362
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,450
also abducted by puppet dolls.

363
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:36,510
If the murderer stole the Dead Bone Spice

364
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,200
in order to break

365
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,440
the illusion formation
in the Black Wind Forest,

366
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,480
then why on earth

367
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:41,810
did he want to enter
the Black Wind Forest?

368
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:44,670
What a pity.

369
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,510
Young Master Qingyang
demonstrated it himself,

370
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:47,840
said it with certainty,

371
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,320
and proved that puppetry

372
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:51,960
couldn't help steal the Spice
from a locked room.

373
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,750
So...

374
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,840
Investigating to this point,

375
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,440
the clue has gone cold again.

376
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:02,870
My Lord, My Lady,

377
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,609
have you ever thought about

378
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:06,670
why those children's graves

379
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,349
in the Black Wind Forest are empty?

380
00:17:11,780 --> 00:17:14,230
Let's assume those children are not dead.

381
00:17:14,349 --> 00:17:15,589
If they're not dead,

382
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:18,560
why are there tombstones erected for them?

383
00:17:20,119 --> 00:17:22,380
Those children will die sooner or later.

384
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:23,270
Two months ago,

385
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:24,640
the murderer abducted the children

386
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,839
not for ransom. The motive is a mystery.

387
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,480
You should go back

388
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:31,070
and start by investigating the children.

389
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:31,880
Here.

390
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:34,550
[Map of Dougu County]

391
00:17:32,030 --> 00:17:32,830
Here.

392
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:33,960
And here.

393
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,240
These alley entrances are

394
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,510
on the only route from the county

395
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:37,510
to the Black Wind Forest.

396
00:17:37,510 --> 00:17:38,680
You must strictly guard them

397
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:39,510
day and night.

398
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:40,920
Once suspicious people are spotted,

399
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:41,880
arrest them immediately.

400
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:42,680
Understood!

401
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:43,880
Let's go.

402
00:17:47,480 --> 00:17:48,270
How is it?

403
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,750
I've checked the household records
several times.

404
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:53,480
Some children's families are farmers,

405
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,510
some sell vegetables,

406
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:55,830
and some do small businesses.

407
00:17:55,830 --> 00:17:57,350
There are boys and girls,
older and younger.

408
00:17:57,350 --> 00:17:58,830
Except for being children,

409
00:17:58,830 --> 00:18:00,430
they have nothing in common.

410
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,880
Is everything ready?

411
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,030
It's time to set off.

412
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:14,090
Where are we going?

413
00:18:14,270 --> 00:18:15,070
Li Si,

414
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:16,510
you trespassed into the government morgue,

415
00:18:16,510 --> 00:18:18,510
broke out of prison,
impersonated an official,

416
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:19,880
and interfered with the investigation.

417
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,680
You are now being arrested
and escorted back to Tianhuang City

418
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:22,680
to stand trial.

419
00:18:27,830 --> 00:18:28,640
Go.

420
00:18:29,510 --> 00:18:30,350
Got it.

421
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:38,750
Mr. Meng,

422
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:40,550
will Lady Constable Frost

423
00:18:40,550 --> 00:18:41,920
run into danger

424
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,270
staying here alone?

425
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,070
What if that culprit

426
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,820
has some tricks up his sleeve?

427
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:52,590
Every extra day those children

428
00:18:52,590 --> 00:18:53,750
stay here just makes things

429
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:55,150
more dangerous for them.

430
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:56,350
Who on earth are you?

431
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:58,480
Why do you care so much about this case?

432
00:18:58,640 --> 00:18:59,470
Or rather,

433
00:19:00,030 --> 00:19:01,350
do those missing children

434
00:19:01,350 --> 00:19:02,950
have anything to do with you?

435
00:19:03,270 --> 00:19:03,720
Go.

436
00:19:09,510 --> 00:19:10,160
My Lord!

437
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:11,510
My Lord!

438
00:19:12,310 --> 00:19:13,310
My Lord, My Lord!

439
00:19:13,350 --> 00:19:15,350
Is there any news of my son, Yuanbao?

440
00:19:16,200 --> 00:19:16,790
No. Not yet.

441
00:19:16,790 --> 00:19:17,680
Stop running.

442
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:19,070
Come over here.

443
00:19:19,070 --> 00:19:20,270
We'll butcher the pig later

444
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:22,110
and offer its head to the Earth God,

445
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:23,310
begging the Earth God

446
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:26,370
to bless my son Yuanbao
to come home as soon as possible.

447
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:28,960
Yuyao, be careful.

448
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,350
Erbao, stop digging.

449
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:31,350
There's no food there,

450
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:32,720
only Yuanbao's tooth.

451
00:19:34,350 --> 00:19:35,110
Tooth?

452
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:41,750
Come here, little piggy.

453
00:19:41,750 --> 00:19:43,100
Time to eat grass.

454
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,350
Madam!

455
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,300
What is it digging for over there?

456
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:50,830
Yuanbao's tooth.

457
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:51,920
According

458
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,160
to our local custom,

459
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:55,270
upper teeth go to the ground;
lower teeth go to the sky.

460
00:19:55,270 --> 00:19:56,240
I took our Yuanbao's

461
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,110
fallen incisor

462
00:19:57,110 --> 00:19:58,240
and buried it there.

463
00:20:02,270 --> 00:20:03,110
Incisor?

464
00:20:11,960 --> 00:20:12,790
Mr. Meng.

465
00:20:14,750 --> 00:20:16,010
Aren't you looking for

466
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:18,110
what those children have in common?

467
00:20:18,510 --> 00:20:20,070
I think I've figured it out.

468
00:20:46,980 --> 00:20:48,400
Mr. Wang, look.

469
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,000
Yuanbao has

470
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,110
reached the stage of losing teeth

471
00:20:50,110 --> 00:20:51,830
and often complains of toothaches.

472
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,790
My teeth hurt so much.

473
00:20:54,550 --> 00:20:55,550
I see.

474
00:20:59,790 --> 00:21:00,590
Mother,

475
00:21:00,750 --> 00:21:02,080
it's my sister's tooth.

476
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,650
My Lord! My Lady!

477
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:08,960
In the other homes

478
00:21:08,960 --> 00:21:10,310
of the missing children,

479
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:12,310
we also found their shed baby teeth.

480
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:14,960
The murderer is indeed

481
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:15,830
looking for kids

482
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:17,630
who are losing their baby teeth.

483
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:19,720
Now we have a direction.

484
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,350
Ask them to make a list

485
00:21:20,350 --> 00:21:21,750
of children
who are losing their baby teeth

486
00:21:21,750 --> 00:21:24,010
and set up ambushes to catch the culprit.

487
00:21:30,440 --> 00:21:31,270
Li Qingyang!

488
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,750
He got away again.

489
00:21:32,850 --> 00:21:33,520
Forget it.

490
00:21:33,550 --> 00:21:34,720
We'll catch him eventually.

491
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:37,580
The priority is to find the kids
losing their teeth.

492
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:51,550
[Dougu County Office]

493
00:21:57,510 --> 00:21:58,310
My Lord!

494
00:21:59,550 --> 00:22:00,310
My Lord!

495
00:22:01,650 --> 00:22:02,650
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

496
00:22:02,710 --> 00:22:03,450
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

497
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,680
My Lord, this...

498
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:04,440
My Lord.

499
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:06,720
My Lord, My Lady,

500
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,790
we've got the complete list.

501
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:08,550
It's the full list

502
00:22:08,550 --> 00:22:09,510
of all the kids who are losing

503
00:22:09,510 --> 00:22:10,640
their baby teeth in Dougu County.

504
00:22:09,910 --> 00:22:11,500
[Chunfeng Hall, Sun Yuyao]

505
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:12,680
Yuyao?

506
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,560
Why is there only one kid?

507
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:15,510
My Lady,

508
00:22:15,510 --> 00:22:16,400
Dougu County is

509
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,510
a very small place.

510
00:22:17,510 --> 00:22:18,880
And with years of droughts,

511
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,350
crop failures, and a population decline,

512
00:22:20,350 --> 00:22:22,510
there can't be many children left!

513
00:22:23,720 --> 00:22:25,070
The night the children went missing,

514
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:26,680
why did the murderer take all the children

515
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,030
except for Yuyao?

516
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,000
That night, Yuyao was with me

517
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:29,880
at the county office.

518
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:31,810
The murderer didn't have a chance.

519
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:34,060
But now Mrs. Hua is taking care of her.

520
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:34,960
Let's go.

521
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:38,110
My Lord! My Lady! Bad news!

522
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:40,290
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

523
00:22:38,110 --> 00:22:38,440
My Lady!

524
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:38,720
What's up?

525
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:39,270
Bad news!

526
00:22:39,270 --> 00:22:40,480
Yuyao is missing!

527
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,410
My Lord, My Lady.

528
00:22:41,510 --> 00:22:43,110
Weren't there staff
from the county office watching her?

529
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:44,750
I just went to put
the freshly butchered pig's head

530
00:22:44,750 --> 00:22:46,110
in the Earth God Temple.

531
00:22:46,110 --> 00:22:47,110
When I turned around,

532
00:22:47,110 --> 00:22:48,510
Yuyao was just gone.

533
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:49,640
My Lord, My Lady, what should we do?

534
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:50,970
Let's find Yuyao first.

535
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:52,230
[Enter the County Office
to Examine Oneself]

536
00:22:53,110 --> 00:22:55,350
Tanghulu (candied haws)!

537
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:57,310
Eat slowly.

538
00:22:58,210 --> 00:23:02,890
[Rice Shop]

539
00:22:59,310 --> 00:23:00,770
Tanghulu (candied haws)!

540
00:23:01,550 --> 00:23:03,350
-I want one, too!
-Kiddo, want some tanghulu?

541
00:23:03,350 --> 00:23:03,920
Here you are.

542
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,310
Come and see!

543
00:23:05,310 --> 00:23:06,310
Let's go, Yuyao.

544
00:23:06,310 --> 00:23:06,920
Take care!

545
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:08,910
Let's go look over there.

546
00:23:10,070 --> 00:23:10,720
Little girl.

547
00:23:10,720 --> 00:23:13,750
-A little hat!
-You've got good taste. This one's pretty.

548
00:23:13,750 --> 00:23:14,590
Sir, take a look.

549
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,050
Come on.

550
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:17,800
The tiger one looks energetic.

551
00:23:18,070 --> 00:23:18,880
Yuyao.

552
00:23:20,030 --> 00:23:20,830
Madam.

553
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,450
I want to see the one behind.

554
00:23:23,790 --> 00:23:24,640
So pretty.

555
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:26,680
Yuyao,

556
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,750
have you had fun today?

557
00:23:29,270 --> 00:23:30,110
Yes.

558
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:35,240
If only Yuanbao, Erniu, and Cuicui were

559
00:23:35,310 --> 00:23:37,270
here, too.

560
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:38,960
Mr. Young Master,

561
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:39,750
were they really

562
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:41,510
taken away by bad guys?

563
00:23:41,960 --> 00:23:42,750
Yuyao,

564
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,110
I promise you

565
00:23:44,310 --> 00:23:45,750
I will definitely save your friends

566
00:23:45,750 --> 00:23:47,310
from the bad guys.

567
00:23:47,310 --> 00:23:48,070
Okay?

568
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:51,110
Don't forget to beat up the bad guys, too.

569
00:23:51,110 --> 00:23:53,110
Of course I will beat up the bad guys.

570
00:23:54,310 --> 00:23:55,480
I hate those

571
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,750
who bully children the most.

572
00:23:58,750 --> 00:23:59,550
Let's go.

573
00:24:02,310 --> 00:24:03,110
Boss.

574
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:06,030
Let's go.

575
00:24:07,750 --> 00:24:08,640
You haven't paid!

576
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:09,310
That bottle

577
00:24:09,310 --> 00:24:10,310
is worth

578
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:11,370
your entire stall.

579
00:24:15,790 --> 00:24:16,960
It smells so good!

580
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:20,400
It's Dead Bone Spice.

581
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:21,790
Where did you get this bottle?

582
00:24:21,790 --> 00:24:22,750
A gentleman used it

583
00:24:22,750 --> 00:24:24,070
to pay just now.

584
00:24:24,350 --> 00:24:25,550
The symbol of the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

585
00:24:25,380 --> 00:24:27,220
[Gathering]

586
00:24:26,310 --> 00:24:27,310
Li Qingyang.

587
00:24:28,000 --> 00:24:29,110
Did you see that gentleman

588
00:24:29,110 --> 00:24:30,110
have a child by his side?

589
00:24:30,110 --> 00:24:30,830
Yes!

590
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,510
He was with a little girl.

591
00:24:32,510 --> 00:24:33,960
He took Yuyao away.

592
00:24:34,750 --> 00:24:36,070
If he were the murderer,

593
00:24:36,070 --> 00:24:38,110
he wouldn't have helped us
investigate the cases all along.

594
00:24:38,110 --> 00:24:39,510
What I'm worried about now is

595
00:24:39,510 --> 00:24:41,000
that even if he's on our side

596
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:42,400
and wants to help us catch the murderer,

597
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:44,130
Yuyao could still be in danger.

598
00:24:44,590 --> 00:24:45,790
Meng, think about it.

599
00:24:45,790 --> 00:24:47,250
Why did he take Yuyao away?

600
00:24:47,310 --> 00:24:48,350
Simply because he knew Yuyao was

601
00:24:48,350 --> 00:24:49,750
the last child.

602
00:24:50,110 --> 00:24:51,400
If he uses Yuyao as bait,

603
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:53,530
the murderer will definitely show up.

604
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,240
This bastard!

605
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:56,750
How dare he treat a child's life

606
00:24:56,750 --> 00:24:57,510
like it's nothing!

607
00:24:57,440 --> 00:25:01,500
[Chunfeng Hall]

608
00:25:09,260 --> 00:25:15,780
[Chunfeng Hall]

609
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:12,920
Emperor of Heaven,

610
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:17,590
Emperor of Earth,

611
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:24,880
there's a boy in my home crying at night.

612
00:25:26,830 --> 00:25:30,680
-Gentlemen passing by,
-Here he comes, as expected.

613
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:33,750
read it three times,

614
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:42,960
and he will sleep soundly until daybreak.

615
00:25:56,830 --> 00:25:57,640
Yuyao,

616
00:25:57,790 --> 00:25:58,640
Yuyao!

617
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:01,720
Come out and play.

618
00:25:59,210 --> 00:26:01,920
[Chunfeng Hall]

619
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,310
Come on.

620
00:26:10,070 --> 00:26:11,110
Come out.

621
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:13,960
Let's play together.

622
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:16,830
Let's have fun together.

623
00:26:39,270 --> 00:26:40,240
My Lord, My Lady.

624
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:44,350
You came neither early nor late,

625
00:26:44,350 --> 00:26:45,270
just in time.

626
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,720
Mr. Meng,

627
00:26:48,790 --> 00:26:49,750
it's too late.

628
00:26:50,310 --> 00:26:51,920
Yuyao's mind has already been seized

629
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:52,980
by the puppet doll.

630
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:55,240
If we act rashly,

631
00:26:55,400 --> 00:26:57,200
Yuyao might be in graver danger.

632
00:26:58,550 --> 00:26:59,720
Good point, Ms. Bai.

633
00:27:00,310 --> 00:27:01,160
Now,

634
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,550
we just need to wait for the puppet doll

635
00:27:03,550 --> 00:27:05,340
to take Yuyao to its destination.

636
00:27:05,340 --> 00:27:08,070
The murderer will
let his or her guard down by then.

637
00:27:08,070 --> 00:27:08,880
That way,

638
00:27:09,200 --> 00:27:10,730
we'll have a better chance.

639
00:27:11,110 --> 00:27:11,750
I didn't expect

640
00:27:11,750 --> 00:27:13,510
you to actually use Yuyao as bait!

641
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:14,920
Who was it that kept saying

642
00:27:14,920 --> 00:27:16,920
hurting children is unforgivable?

643
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,830
Mr. Meng,

644
00:27:18,110 --> 00:27:19,710
if you are done lecturing me,

645
00:27:19,720 --> 00:27:21,550
why don't we go after them together?

646
00:27:21,550 --> 00:27:22,510
How's that?

647
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,380
[Chunfeng Hall]

648
00:27:33,140 --> 00:27:37,010
[Chunfeng Hall]

649
00:27:33,350 --> 00:27:35,410
Golden needles blocked my channels,

650
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:37,880
and a heavy strike sealed my acupoints.

651
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,480
Great,

652
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,930
even an immortal can't escape now.

653
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:43,830
Li Si,

654
00:27:44,480 --> 00:27:46,110
I hate people who disregard

655
00:27:46,110 --> 00:27:48,170
children's lives the most in my life.

656
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:49,400
Once the murderer is brought to justice,

657
00:27:49,400 --> 00:27:50,160
I swear I'll throw you

658
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:52,620
into the Divine Constable Bureau's prison!

659
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:55,750
Let's go.

660
00:28:45,310 --> 00:28:46,240
Dead Bone Spice?

661
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,270
As expected,

662
00:28:49,920 --> 00:28:51,950
the missing children from the county are

663
00:28:51,950 --> 00:28:53,750
right in this Black Wind Forest.

664
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:16,510
So this Dead Bone Spice

665
00:29:16,510 --> 00:29:17,240
can not only break

666
00:29:17,240 --> 00:29:18,720
the illusion formation
in the Black Wind Forest

667
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:21,000
but also open a path
through these flowers.

668
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,960
This proves

669
00:29:22,510 --> 00:29:23,970
we've found the right way.

670
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:01,400
There seems to be some writing

671
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,730
behind this spider web.

672
00:30:22,510 --> 00:30:23,440
This is

673
00:30:24,110 --> 00:30:25,310
the writing of Liluo?

674
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:26,720
I recognize it,

675
00:30:26,720 --> 00:30:28,070
but I don't know what it means.

676
00:30:28,070 --> 00:30:29,200
The Kingdom of Liluo that was

677
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,510
destroyed
by the late Emperor Wuzong of Shi

678
00:30:30,510 --> 00:30:31,510
47 years ago?

679
00:30:41,020 --> 00:30:41,820
Could it be

680
00:30:42,120 --> 00:30:43,360
that the puppet dolls

681
00:30:43,380 --> 00:30:45,250
and the incident from 17 years ago

682
00:30:45,280 --> 00:30:47,880
have something to do
with the Kingdom of Liluo?

683
00:31:25,650 --> 00:31:26,480
Zhenzhu?

684
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:35,790
Meng Rui!

685
00:31:50,640 --> 00:31:51,440
Li Si!

686
00:31:52,400 --> 00:31:53,200
What...

687
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:54,110
Let me check.

688
00:31:55,640 --> 00:31:56,440
It's nothing.

689
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,510
I'm fine.

690
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:03,490
It's just that I was stabbed

691
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:05,440
by Lord Constable Ghost last time.

692
00:32:06,550 --> 00:32:08,440
Now the wound has reopened.

693
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:09,650
It won't kill me.

694
00:32:12,030 --> 00:32:12,830
Sorry.

695
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:15,440
Li Si,

696
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:17,290
thank you for saving us.

697
00:32:19,750 --> 00:32:21,610
My Lord, My Lady, what's this for?

698
00:32:22,310 --> 00:32:23,160
I'm fine.

699
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:25,830
The priority is to save them.

700
00:32:25,830 --> 00:32:26,590
Let's go.

701
00:32:43,750 --> 00:32:45,480
It was originally a sure thing.

702
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:46,960
I didn't expect that Li Si

703
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:48,440
would risk his own life

704
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:50,000
to break through the sealed acupoints

705
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,160
and save those two
from the Divine Constable Bureau.

706
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:54,510
You've really disappointed me.

707
00:32:55,890 --> 00:32:57,070
Please rest assured!

708
00:32:57,070 --> 00:32:58,640
I will protect God Kelu

709
00:32:58,720 --> 00:33:00,270
and the Sacred Moluo Fruit

710
00:33:00,270 --> 00:33:01,730
even at the cost of my life!

711
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:30,070
So big.

712
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:37,160
This flower must be

713
00:33:37,750 --> 00:33:38,640
the mother plant

714
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,570
of those bizarre flowers outside.

715
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,730
Inside these are all children!

716
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:10,679
It's Yuanbao.

717
00:34:12,360 --> 00:34:13,150
Yuanbao.

718
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,550
Yuanbao.

719
00:34:15,510 --> 00:34:16,360
Yuanbao!

720
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:06,150
The person who set up Spider's Tear

721
00:35:06,150 --> 00:35:07,630
must be nearby.

722
00:35:08,880 --> 00:35:09,760
Be careful.

723
00:35:21,710 --> 00:35:22,570
Show yourself!

724
00:36:27,110 --> 00:36:27,920
May I

725
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:30,160
have your name, lady?

726
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:43,320
How dare you profane
the Sacred Moluo Fruit?

727
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:47,770
It's livor mortis.

728
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,200
Wait a minute.

729
00:36:49,510 --> 00:36:50,670
Don't you think

730
00:36:51,110 --> 00:36:53,110
the dress of the woman in front of us

731
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,680
looks very familiar?

732
00:36:56,920 --> 00:36:58,070
Tumi House was burglarized

733
00:36:58,070 --> 00:36:59,360
2 months ago.

734
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:00,480
But

735
00:37:00,670 --> 00:37:01,550
somehow,

736
00:37:01,550 --> 00:37:02,510
the owner of this shop

737
00:37:02,510 --> 00:37:03,150
seemed to have

738
00:37:03,150 --> 00:37:04,480
suffered a great hit

739
00:37:04,670 --> 00:37:05,550
and gone mad.

740
00:37:05,710 --> 00:37:07,070
Lady Fragrance?

741
00:37:07,480 --> 00:37:08,810
The person in front of us

742
00:37:08,880 --> 00:37:10,630
must be the long-missing

743
00:37:10,670 --> 00:37:12,360
real owner of Tumi House,

744
00:37:12,550 --> 00:37:13,920
Lady Fragrance.

745
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:16,670
You guessed it right.

746
00:37:17,110 --> 00:37:18,920
Her elder brother used her blood

747
00:37:18,920 --> 00:37:20,450
to refine Dead Bone Spice.

748
00:37:20,710 --> 00:37:22,190
And I used her body

749
00:37:22,190 --> 00:37:23,880
to make a human puppet.

750
00:37:24,360 --> 00:37:26,440
Compared to puppet dolls,

751
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:28,960
this lifelike human puppet is

752
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,620
far superior.

753
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,070
Come out!

754
00:37:32,110 --> 00:37:33,710
Or I'll cut down this flower!

755
00:37:35,550 --> 00:37:38,150
The only chance of survival
for these children

756
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,710
relies entirely

757
00:37:39,710 --> 00:37:41,510
on the great Tianmoluo.

758
00:37:42,070 --> 00:37:43,710
If the flower dies,

759
00:37:43,710 --> 00:37:45,240
they won't survive either!

760
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:47,840
This Spirit of Tianmoluo is

761
00:37:48,190 --> 00:37:51,110
a remnant from the ancient Liluo Sect.

762
00:37:51,710 --> 00:37:54,070
These Moluo Flowers in the canyon are

763
00:37:54,070 --> 00:37:56,280
all its descendants.

764
00:37:56,920 --> 00:38:00,670
It is the soul of God Kelu!

765
00:38:06,960 --> 00:38:08,190
Liluo fell

766
00:38:08,190 --> 00:38:09,110
47 years ago.

767
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:12,090
You were the one who transplanted it here?

768
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:14,230
Forty-seven years ago,

769
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:17,230
the Shi Empire wiped out Liluo,

770
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:19,240
committing atrocious crimes!

771
00:38:19,710 --> 00:38:21,840
Tianmoluo taking root here was

772
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:24,710
the will of God Kelu.

773
00:38:25,150 --> 00:38:28,360
It's going to use the lifeblood
of the Great Shi's children

774
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:30,880
to grow the fruits of revenge!
